t a verdict)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"1be6afe3df35ad9962ed2c01b28062d8","originalFileName":"7fd55002-ab7b-49a1-afad-e32c8b951197-attachment.json","ext":".json","contentType":"application/json","contentLength":2975,"name":"oracle verdict"},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #10): Pass — search + sort state across chart open/back and Today/All switch, both modes"},"testCase":{"id":"c3f8bd4b904eb77273f2cb5d5b6d2e33","externalId":"f9cb0746a43bc085392f5f5bbe583964","name":"[dev] S16 List after opening a chart and Back, and across Today's Visits ↔ All Residents, both contexts","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S16"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S16</b> 「打开病历再 Back 之后的列表，以及 Today's Visits ↔ All Residents 之间，两个模式」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">List after opening a chart and Back, and across Today's Visits ↔ All Residents, both contexts</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U3</b> Room is the primary sort: the list opens in room order, in both contexts (ticket How-it-works step 3: 'Room is the primary/default sort').（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 4）</li><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 2；TFA-92581 AC 5）</li><li><b>U2</b> Hospital: sort by room, by name and by status each puts the list in the correct order.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 4；TFA-92581 AC 5）</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 3；TFA-92581 AC 6）</li><li><b>U7</b> Nursing Home: sort by room (unit/room), by name and by status each puts the residents in the correct order.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 4；TFA-92581 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>状态迁移（state-transition） — 按先后顺序走（加 → 改 → 删、第 1 天 → 第 2 天、离线 → 在线），每一步之后看状态对不对。</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture (one Hospital patient; one resident on Today's Visits)</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: open the list; type 'pneumonia' and choose the name sort; open {hospitalPatient}'s chart; press Back. Nursing Home: open Today's Visits; type 'zz-none'; open All Residents; clear the search, type 'QA Resident' and choose the name sort; open {snfResident}'s chart; press Back</p><p><b>Then </b>Both lists open on room order. With a matching search the record is listed under the chosen sort. After Back the list is not empty and shows no no-match message. 'zz-none' on Today's Visits lists nobody and says so. No other-context record appears at any step</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs: cp1 and cp4 mustContain the record and 'option &quot;Sort: Room number&quot; [selected]' (U3). cp2 and cp7 mustContain the record and 'option &quot;Sort: Name A–Z&quot; [selected]'. cp3 and cp8 mustContain the record and mustNotContain the no-match message. A list emptied or stuck on a no-match message after Back fails, whether or not the search was kept. …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U10；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S16 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-03.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：VISUAL · 视觉（截图给人看） — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S16</p><p><b>List after opening a chart and Back, and across Today's Visits ↔ All Residents, both contexts</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>generated/tc03s16/verdict.json</code>). Agent: 38 turns, 63 s, $0.22.</p><p><b>Recorded (evidence only):</b></p><ul><li>s16-hosp-after-back.md: (Q9: search text kept after Back) fail: missing &quot;pneumonia&quot; (in subtree &quot;textbox &quot;Search patients&quot;&quot;)</li><li>s16-hosp-after-back.md: (Q9: name sort kept after Back) fail: missing &quot;option &quot;Sort: Name A–Z&quot; [selected]&quot;</li><li>s16-nh-all-after-switch.md: (Q10: 'zz-none' carried into All Residents) pass: &quot;zz-none&quot; present (in subtree &quot;textbox &quot;Search patients&quot;&quot;)</li><li>s16-nh-all-after-switch.md: (Q10: the empty list carried into All Residents) pass: &quot;No residents match&quot; present</li><li>s16-nh-after-back.md: (Q9: search text kept after Back) fail: missing &quot;QA Resident&quot; (in subtree &quot;textbox &quot;Search patients&quot;&quot;)</li><li>s16-nh-after-back.md: (Q9: name sort kept after Back) fail: missing &quot;option &quot;Sort: Name A–Z&quot; [selected]&quot;</li></ul><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U10 (#10, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — List state after chart and Back. Its checks read whole-list order; another part's patients would change it.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #10, U10; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — search + sort state across chart open/back and Today/All switch, both modes</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S16 List after opening a chart and Back, and across Today's Visits ↔ All Residents, both contexts"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"23857b305b5d69e1361fc94b898894c2","originalFileName":"bb2498ad-3ad4-4568-9134-4bc0f84c855b-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":3113},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"8f4fde673ec22cb56b90c8abde49c06f","originalFileName":"1e028308-95a4-453a-b0f9-98